## Shared working agreement

- Treat `AGENTS.md` as the repository entry point and follow the linked guide that applies to the current task.
- Keep changes small, explain intent in the change description, and surface uncertainty before making a structural decision.
- Preserve user-owned files and never add credentials, access tokens, or production data to source control.
- Record architecture and operational decisions in `docs/project-bootstrap/` or the appropriate architecture document.

